  "name": "alexandria-server",
  "description": "A legacy Rust backend for a library management system utilizing the Iron web framework and PostgreSQL for persistent storage. It provides RESTful endpoints for book inventory management, student record tracking, and transactional history logging, including integration with the Google Books API for ISBN metadata retrieval. The system implements scrypt-based password hashing and structured permission levels for granular user access control.",
